{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19918","headline":"秋怀 十三 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜气入病骨，老人身生冰。\n衰毛暗相刺，冷痛不可胜。\n鷕鷕伸至明，强强揽所凭。\n瘦坐形欲折，腹饥心将崩。\n劝药左右愚，言语如见憎。\n耸耳噎神开，始知功用能。\n日中视余疮，暗隙闻绳蝇。\n彼齅一何酷，此味半点凝。\n潜毒尔无厌，余生我堪矜。\n冻飞幸不远，冬令反心惩。\n出没各有时，寒热苦相凌。\n仰谢调运翁，请命愿有徵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}